  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Surge Support (DSS Water) &#x2013; Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dutch Surge Support (DSS water) responds to the needs during water related disasters around the globe by deploying excellent experts from the Dutch water sector.With this facility the Netherlands aims to contribute to a better international response to water and sanitation related disasters and assist in building up knowledge in dealing with these emergencies.The Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) administers DSS at the request of the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs and the Ministry of Infrastructure and Environment.For more information: Dutch Disaster Risk Reduction and Surge Support (on english.rvo.nl)Url = https://english.rvo.nl/subsidies-financing/drrs</narrative>
  </description>
